- [ ] useState for array data initialized as useState<string[]>([]).
- [ ] API responses validated with Array.isArray(...) and fallback to [] where appropriate.
- [ ] UI adheres to the visual style and typography guidelines, with correct color palette and spacing.
- [ ] After signup, user is redirected to onboarding wizard if onboardingPreferred is true, otherwise to the dashboard with a short tour.
- [ ] Accessibility checks pass (aria attributes, focus states, keyboard navigation).

